# Script output: regenerate with hack/scripts/*, never commit.
# Dated state dumps, not intent. Ignored by directory rather than by content, so
# that a future diag line dumping a node-token or kubeconfig cannot land in
# permanent history.
hack/logs/
hack/scripts/tailscale-subnet-router-prompt-v2.md
